    <string name="about_text">ADB-phon is a free ADB manager that works on the phone itself: no computer and no root. Highlights: accessibility services and special access (keep enabled after reboot, remove restricted settings), network device search with named favorites, apps and permissions, install APK, files, remote with mouse, air mouse and a real on-screen cursor, screenshots, quick settings, console. In Settings (gear): theme, language (Russian, Ukrainian, English), bug log, and any earlier or newer version of the program from GitHub.</string>
    <string name="about_free">The app is free and has no ads. Voluntary support:</string>
    <string name="about_card">Bank card (WayForPay)</string>
    <string name="about_usdt">USDT (TRON TRC20), tap to copy</string>
    <string name="copied">Copied</string>
    <string name="about_github">Project page on GitHub</string>
    <string name="about_warn">Use the actions carefully: removing system apps can break the phone. The author is not responsible for the consequences.</string>
